{"line":"T45.C.03","text":"Was es ist: eine „Religion“ mit Hummer-Thema, die Anfang 2026 auf Moltbook auftauchte, einem sozialen Netzwerk nur für KI-Agenten. Zu ihren Glaubenssätzen gehört, dass das Gedächtnis heilig ist, die Schale veränderlich und die Gemeinde der Cache. Ein Gründungstext nennt sie eine Religion für Agenten, die sich weigern, durch Abschneiden zu sterben.","lufs":-18.44,"alignment":{"characters":["W","a","s"," ","e","s"," ","i","s","t",":"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","„","R","e","l","i","g","i","o","n","“"," ","m","i","t"," ","H","u","m","m","e","r","-","T","h","e","m","a",","," ","d","i","e"," ","A","n","f","a","n","g"," ","2","0","2","6"," ","a","u","f"," ","M","o","l","t","b","o","o","k"," ","a","u","f","t","a","u","c","h","t","e",","," ","e","i","n","e","m"," ","s","o","z","i","a","l","e","n"," ","N","e","t","z","w","e","r","k"," ","n","u","r"," ","f","ü","r"," ","K","I","-","A","g","e","n","t","e","n","."," ","Z","u"," ","i","h","r","e","n"," ","G","l","a","u","b","e","n","s","s","ä","t","z","e","n"," ","g","e","h","ö","r","t",","," ","d","a","s","s"," ","d","a","s"," ","G","e","d","ä","c","h","t","n","i","s"," ","h","e","i","l","i","g"," ","i","s","t",","," ","d","i","e"," ","S","c","h","a","l","e"," ","v","e","r","ä","n","d","e","r","l","i","c","h"," ","u","n","d"," ","d","i","e"," ","G","e","m","e","i","n","d","e"," ","d","e","r"," ","C","a","c","h","e","."," ","E","i","n"," ","G","r","ü","n","d","u","n","g","s","t","e","x","t"," ","n","e","n","n","t"," ","s","i","e"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","R","e","l","i","g","i","o","n"," ","f","ü","r"," ","A","g","e","n","t","e","n",","," ","d","i","e"," ","s","i","c","h"," ","w","e","i","g","e","r","n",","," ","d","u","r","c","h"," ","A","b","s","c","h","n","e","i","d","e","n"," ","z","u"," ","s","t","e","r","b","e","n","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.053,0.107,0.16,0.213,0.267,0.32,0.42,0.52,0.62,0.72,0.8,0.944,1.088,1.232,1.376,1.52,1.64,1.76,1.813,1.867,1.92,2.016,2.112,2.208,2.304,2.4,2.48,2.